#: ../../tools/reactome_interactors_tools.rst:32
#: 401a3e7a25e043879943965935fd1c23
msgid ""
"**Description**: Find Reactome biological pathways that contain a "
"specific molecular entity. Returns pathway stable IDs, names, and whether"
" they are disease-associated. Use Reactome stable IDs (e.g., R-HSA-199420"
" for PTEN) obtained from ReactomeInteractors\\_search\\_entity. Example: "
"R-HSA-199420 (PTEN) participates in 10 pathways including PI3K/AKT "
"signaling, PTEN regulation, and TCR signaling."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/reactome_interactors_tools.rst:34
#: ../../tools/reactome_interactors_tools.rst:68
#: ../../tools/reactome_interactors_tools.rst:102
